comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-04T08:44:51.089Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-04: all-status searches covered terminal create, require_close_reason, --resolution, importer closure, atomic lifecycle mutation, and create/update/close policy. Closed pm-2ew0w3 fixed contradictory terminal transition policy, but no active item owns the complete atomic importer-facing terminal-create contract described by GitHub #887. GitHub source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/887"
  "2026-08-04T11:47:36.827Z","harness:codex","Evidence: terminal create now accepts closeReason/completedAt across SDK, CLI, tool schema, and JSON-document ingestion; explicit reason wins over message/resolution and completed_at remains distinct from local closed_at. Focused linked tests passed; isolated packed npm/npx consumer created and reread a terminal item with source timestamp; full coverage passed 6807/6807 at 100/100/100/100."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-04T11:47:52.390Z","harness:codex",Imported completion time and local closure mutation time are different facts; terminal creation must preserve both in one transaction instead of rewriting source history.
